										</P>
									</td>
		</tr><tr>
			<td align="Center"><font color="White">
										<P style="FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana">Title:&nbsp;
											<span id="dl_news__ctl2_Label4"><font face="Verdana" color="White" size="1">Hello Boy..... </font></span></P>
										<P style="FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana">Date:
											<span id="dl_news__ctl2_Label2"><font face="Verdana" color="White" size="1">Nov 18 2002  7:40AM</font></span></P>
										<P>
											<span id="dl_news__ctl2_Label1"><font face="Verdana" color="White" size="1">Klandicar Round 2...<BR><BR>FIGHT!<BR><IMG src="http://home.mchsi.com/~serendipitousexistence/KlanCorpse.jpg"><BR>Get on the ground you ugly ass clown.<BR><BR>Gratz Wopa on our first sleepers key awarding. Gratz Pyrain on Peerless BP.<BR><BR>Also killed Vindicator again like clockwork. Gratz Panegyvver on your boots.<BR><BR>later<BR><BR>-sani <BR><BR></font></span></P>
